- **ChinaMobile**: China Mobile (single ISP).
- **ChinaUnicom**: China Unicom (single ISP).
- **ChinaTelecom**: China Telecom (single ISP).

> If your account is included in the China single-ISP bandwidth whitelist, you can set this parameter to **ChinaTelecom** (China Telecom), **ChinaUnicom** (China Unicom), or **ChinaMobile** (China Mobile).', example='BGP', position='Query'),
  ownerAccount?: string(name='OwnerAccount', position='Query'),
